      "section": "One region, three collections",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Three collections on one region around MYC: CTCF peaks with the hg38 genes, the Hi-C contact triangle, and CTCF and H3K27ac ChIP depth. Type a locus or a gene in the navigator header, or brush its axis, and the navigator and every track below move to that region; the matrix re-reads it at the resolution that fits. This is the layout nf-core/hic, chipseq and cutandrun outputs combine into once their peaks, coverage and mcool are ingested.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
